# Screenshots

Replace the placeholder PNG files in this directory with actual screenshots:

1. `whatsapp-order-flow.png` — Customer sending an order via WhatsApp, agent extracting items and confirming
2. `review-dashboard.png` — The /review page showing pending escalations with reason badges and live stats
3. `order-detail.png` — Order detail page with items, timeline, and approve/reject actions
4. `loading-list.png` — The /loading page showing dispatch list grouped by route
5. `tally-voucher.png` — Generated Tally voucher XML ready for import

To capture screenshots:
1. Start local dev: `./scripts/run_local.sh`
2. Send test orders via the roundtrip API or WhatsApp
3. Open browser to http://localhost:8080/review (passcode: from env)
4. Take screenshots of each view
5. Save to this directory with the names above
